ation  and lucasfilm games  together we couldn't be more excited  about what we'll be able to show you in  the future all of us are of course huge  star wars fans too one of the nice parts  about building a team to make a big star  wars game is the ability to instantly  bond with all the new people of your  favorite aspects of star wars we all  have different star wars memorabilia  behind us in every call and it always  sparks up a good conversation  all right thanks ryan very exciting  stuff and i'm definitely dying to see  more of that one thank you sid it will  be some time before we're ready to show  more but we're very excited about being  able to reveal more in the future all  right and that's it for our show
 

